{"conversation_id":"f096c2cd-519e-48ce-961c-9164a6ca7240","response":"Vaccines have been extensively studied and are considered a crucial tool in preventing infectious diseases. The scientific consensus is clear: vaccines are safe and effective. Multiple reputable sources, including the Centers for Disease Control and Prevention (CDC), the World Health Organization (WHO), and peer-reviewed medical journals have comprehensively documented their safety and efficacy.

